WEBVTT

NOTE Preproduction timing only. No final audio exists yet. Retiming and listening review are required before use in a released video.

00:01.000 --> 00:03.500
You're busy doing the work.

00:03.500 --> 00:06.000
But while you're working,

00:06.000 --> 00:08.500
your next customer could be calling.

00:12.000 --> 00:14.600
Bonjour! Merci d'avoir appelé
Plomberie Martin.

00:14.600 --> 00:16.300
For English, press 1.

00:17.000 --> 00:18.800
How can I help you?

00:19.000 --> 00:22.000
Hi, my kitchen faucet keeps dripping.

00:22.200 --> 00:25.100
All day, or just when it's on?

00:25.300 --> 00:26.500
All day.

00:27.000 --> 00:30.200
Would tomorrow at two thirty work?

00:30.500 --> 00:31.300
Perfect.

00:31.700 --> 00:34.000
Your name and service address?

00:34.500 --> 00:37.600
Alex Roy. Twenty-four Cedar Lane.

00:38.000 --> 00:39.300
You're booked.

00:39.300 --> 00:42.500
You'll receive a confirmation text shortly.

00:42.500 --> 00:44.500
Have a great day!

00:52.000 --> 00:55.000
While you were focused on your job,

00:55.000 --> 00:58.500
TradeCatch was already booking
your next one.

01:00.500 --> 01:02.300
Stop missing calls.

01:02.300 --> 01:04.500
Start booking more jobs.

01:04.500 --> 01:07.100
Let TradeCatch handle your calls

01:07.100 --> 01:10.000
while you handle your business.
